| **QualitiesDiff** | `{ removed[], updated[], added[] }` | name, key, benchmarks*, attributes* |
| **AuthorsDiff** | `{ removed[], updated[], added[] }` | name, email, attributes* |
| **FilesDiff** | `{ removed[], updated[], added[] }` | name, mime, remote, size, hash, attributes* |
| **FoldersDiff** | `{ removed[], updated[], added[] }` | name, parent, description, attributes* |
